Alice has 3 brothers, and each of those brothers has 2 sisters. This means the total number of sisters in the family is 2, because the brothers are referring to the same set of sisters.

Those 2 sisters include Alice herself and one other sister.

Therefore, Alice has 1 sister.爱丽丝有3个兄弟，说明这个家庭一共有3个男孩。  
